WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.820
The City Council heard our plea.

2
00:00:03.820 --> 00:00:09.980
They passed an ordinance; the ordinance was Ordinance 222.

3
00:00:09.980 --> 00:00:19.760
That said that black people could sit from the back to the front and whites could sit from the front to the back.

4
00:00:19.760 --> 00:00:24.860
There would be no reserved seats, and that first come, first served.
